▼Remember_INFO records a sentence in the searchable collection under a creature name; INPUT is the creature name, then the sentence ◆

▽_authored ▷AUTHOR
FieldNotes
Named FieldNotes, it takes no arguments and returns the name of every creature it recorded, one name on each line. It fetches the text at http://127.0.0.1:8473/creatures.csv, sets aside the header line, and for each remaining line reads three comma separated fields: the creature name, its habitat and a trait. For each line it asks the model for one sentence about that creature and hands the creature name and that sentence to Remember.
